                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Moerdijk-SheafCohomology.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Discussion in the more general context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nonabelian+cohomology"} nonabelian cohomology
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinity-stacks"} infinity-stacks
            is due to:
          %ul
            %li#Brown1973
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kenneth+Brown"}> Kenneth Brown
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BrownAHT"} Abstract Homotopy Theory and Generalized Sheaf Cohomology
              %strong 186
              (1973) 419-458 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://www.jstor.org/stable/1996573"}> jstor:1996573
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            This uses homotopical structures of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+fibrant+objects"} category of fibrant objects
            on complexes of abelian sheaves. Discussion of actual
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+chain+complexes"} model structure on chain complexes
            of abelian sheaves is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Hovey"}> Mark Hovey
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Model category structures on chain complexes of sheaves
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.mathaware.org/tran/2001-353-06/S0002-9947-01-02721-0/S0002-9947-01-02721-0.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            A discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C4%8Cech+cohomology"} Čech cohomology
            description of sheaf cohomology along the above lines is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tibor+Beke"}> Tibor Beke
              ,
              %em Higher Čech Theory
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.uiuc.edu/K-theory/0646/"}> web
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.uiuc.edu/K-theory/0646/cech.pdf"} pdf
